        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Swiss HWI plant in 2000 with wet flue gas scrubber and low-dust SCR DeNOx facility. Gross thermal efficiency 74.4% and gross electric efficiency 10%.\n\n# Included processes\nwaste-specific air and water emissions from incineration, auxiliary material consumption for flue gas cleaning. Short-term emissions to river water and long-term emissions to ground water from residual material landfill (from solidified fly ashes and scrubber slugde). Process energy demands for HWI.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
